  "Id": "58ff3790-5ec5-4113-8e37-a934c3a7fdcd"/*RepeatAxis*/,
  "Description": "Repeats the incoming field infinitely along one axis.\n\nIt needs an incoming field like [BoxSDF] or [TorusSDF]. Render the result with [RaymarchField] and inspect it with [VisualizeFieldDistance].\n\nSee also: [RepeatFieldLimit], [RepeatField3], [RepeatPolar]",
